# Changes to the guardrails need an owner's review. With a ruleset on main that requires review from
# code owners, these lines make the enforcement files change-controlled: a pull request can edit
# them, but it merges only when an owner has approved. CI judges every pull request with the base
# branch's copy of the checks, so a change here cannot grade itself.
